{
  "_comment": "Track REG_arch_v6b (Feature-axis single-axis, 2026-05-14 PM): Track T baseline + REG_arch FiLM (1-layer trunk, baseline) + 6 NEW daily-regime features appended to regime_prior (d_prior 6→12). Features computed from past-N-day y_600 stats (causal, day-D excluded): (30,mean), (30,std), (30,vol_mean), (30,vol_std), (7,mean), (7,vol_mean). Captures: drift regime, drift instability, vol regime level, vol-of-vol, recent drift, recent vol level. Targets mid/lo regime separation that vol_1h alone cannot distinguish. Independent from v6a (architecture).",
